Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.06,0:00:00.33,Caption,,0,0,0,,How does a
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.34,0:00:01.04,Caption,,0,0,0,,net stop a
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.05,0:00:02.11,Caption,,0,0,0,,twenty-ton boulder?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.37,0:00:03.28,Caption,,0,0,0,,Mountain roads hang
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.30,0:00:04.12,Caption,,0,0,0,,steel nets on
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.13,0:00:04.60,Caption,,0,0,0,,the slopes
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.61,0:00:05.15,Caption,,0,0,0,,above them.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.41,0:00:05.84,Caption,,0,0,0,,The net is
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.85,0:00:06.77,Caption,,0,0,0,,woven from steel
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.78,0:00:07.63,Caption,,0,0,0,,rings, like
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.64,0:00:08.30,Caption,,0,0,0,,chain mail.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.56,0:00:09.04,Caption,,0,0,0,,When a rock
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.05,0:00:10.05,Caption,,0,0,0,,hits, the net
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.07,0:00:10.65,Caption,,0,0,0,,doesn't try to
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.66,0:00:11.43,Caption,,0,0,0,,stop it dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.69,0:00:12.47,Caption,,0,0,0,,It stretches like
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.48,0:00:13.73,Caption,,0,0,0,,a trampoline, more
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.74,0:00:14.57,Caption,,0,0,0,,than twenty feet.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.83,0:00:15.32,Caption,,0,0,0,,And the ropes
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.33,0:00:15.88,Caption,,0,0,0,,that hold it
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.90,0:00:16.41,Caption,,0,0,0,,pull through
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.42,0:00:17.22,Caption,,0,0,0,,brake rings.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.48,0:00:18.39,Caption,,0,0,0,,These steel loops
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.40,0:00:19.64,Caption,,0,0,0,,shrink and bend,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.00,0:00:20.82,Caption,,0,0,0,,turning the speed
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.83,0:00:21.43,Caption,,0,0,0,,into heat.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.69,0:00:22.41,Caption,,0,0,0,,A slow stop
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.42,0:00:23.28,Caption,,0,0,0,,keeps the forces
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.30,0:00:24.06,Caption,,0,0,0,,low, so
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.07,0:00:24.99,Caption,,0,0,0,,nothing snaps.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.25,0:00:26.13,Caption,,0,0,0,,The biggest nets
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.15,0:00:27.15,Caption,,0,0,0,,stop twenty tons
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.17,0:00:28.04,Caption,,0,0,0,,at sixty miles
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.05,0:00:28.49,Caption,,0,0,0,,an hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.75,0:00:30.30,Caption,,0,0,0,,Afterward, crews clear
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.31,0:00:31.06,Caption,,0,0,0,,the rock and
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.07,0:00:32.12,Caption,,0,0,0,,replace the brakes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.38,0:00:32.90,Caption,,0,0,0,,That's what those
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.92,0:00:33.66,Caption,,0,0,0,,steel nets on
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.68,0:00:34.33,Caption,,0,0,0,,mountain cliffs
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.35,0:00:34.89,Caption,,0,0,0,,are for.
